      }
    }
  ],
  "Sections": [
    {
      "Id": "0059af6e-4f43-4a20-81ee-064d0f932e1a",
      "Label": "...and pick from a list of meshes to draw.",
      "ParentSectionId": "d0729712-35f1-4955-81db-6c74338387da",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": 2850.385,
        "Y": 830.0475
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 680.0,
        "Y": 229.0
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "02b96af0-3803-4ddb-af58-2f839afe52c1",
      "Title": "nerds call them \"Normalized\" or \"Saturated\".\nThe Pow function is very useful to add easing to your normalized values.\n\n",
      "Label": "If values fall in the range between 0 and 1, ",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": -407.0729,
        "Y": 690.3607
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 600.57446,
        "Y": 251.09338
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "0f56d01a-e2bd-4948-8357-f52caa52a7ae",
      "Title": "It can be useful to drive continuous values like rotations and phases.",
      "Label": "[Counter] Similar to [AnimValue].",
      "ParentSectionId": "5f9df0dd-39ec-49e9-894b-e820413fdb70",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": 227.11502,
        "Y": 701.56165
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 688.1935,
        "Y": 184.6991
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "10deadb1-757b-4c5a-a798-7184a5868feb",
      "Title": "\nYou can animate any scalar and vector parameter in the parameter window.\n\nAnimated operators have a small orange \"animation\" tag in the corner, \nlike this one:",
      "Label": "TiXL also provides possibilities for keyframe animations.",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": 1889.5944,
        "Y": 35.744354
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 553.3094,
        "Y": 331.04028
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "1e8fabb8-c4ff-42e8-bf8a-a8063a46a54b",
      "Title": "This playground shows some examples. \nTry to select the operators at the end of each graph and play with them.\n\n(please activate the Idle Motion mode in the time controls)",
      "Label": "TiXL is all about animation, so there are endless possibilities for it. ",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": -407.8169,
        "Y": -171.97456
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 1527.809,
        "Y": 204.4709
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "363650ae-441e-4058-9319-6c33eea9d63f",
      "Title": "to make things jiggle in a natural way.\nPerfect for camera shaking and so many other things.",
      "Label": "[PerlinNoise] is the go-to algorithm ",
      "ParentSectionId": "5f9df0dd-39ec-49e9-894b-e820413fdb70",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": 227.03085,
        "Y": 886.26074
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 688.2776,
        "Y": 259.26575
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "531dc9b0-ad02-4259-9719-5977dcc4adba",
      "Label": "You can always combine things.",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": -407.8169,
        "Y": 466.30444
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 599.6805,
        "Y": 214.05621
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "558cb89d-7c4c-42fb-a837-fa6eec50fcf6",
      "Label": "Click me",
      "ParentSectionId": "5f9df0dd-39ec-49e9-894b-e820413fdb70",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": 915.3085,
        "Y": 243.40295
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 201.4292,
        "Y": 458.1587
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "5f9df0dd-39ec-49e9-894b-e820413fdb70",
      "Title": "These operators are such powerful tools that we should explain them \nin detail:",
      "Label": "Some operators are animated.",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": 212.32788,
        "Y": 41.12854
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 907.6642,
        "Y": 1389.7975
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "61c00d70-55f1-496d-ab8b-d75387a440e6",
      "Title": "Notice that TiXL's time is not in secs but in musical bars - 4 beats is 1 bar.\n4 bars form a measure. This means that your animation\nwill work for all BPM rates!\n\n\n",
      "Label": "Using time. ",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": -407.8169,
        "Y": 41.12854
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 599.6805,
        "Y": 166.42197
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "6e01257e-ea2a-426e-95f1-57706f756c0c",
      "Title": "Take a look at the following example:\n\nA different version of effects is triggered if any of the events on the left occur.",
      "Label": "Another powerful option for procedural animation is [TriggerAnim].",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": 1276.4916,
        "Y": 389.44254
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 1166.4122,
        "Y": 378.22897
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "7333c3c1-a0f0-41c9-9fd8-518804226909",
      "Title": "AKA \"LFO\" (Low-frequency operator).\nYou can adjust its main parameters directly by holding \nthe CTRL key.\n- Drag Up/Down on the left adjusts the rate in steps /4x4\n- Drag the graph to adjust ratio and bias",
      "Label": "[AnimValue] operator",
      "ParentSectionId": "5f9df0dd-39ec-49e9-894b-e820413fdb70",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": 225.75876,
        "Y": 127.2958
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 689.5497,
        "Y": 392.12656
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "95812bb4-d98b-4bbe-b7e7-577c881298ca",
      "Title": "by cycling through a gradient. Notice how [Counter] uses a modulo to repeat the cycle.",
      "Label": "We create a new clear color for our render target ",
      "ParentSectionId": "d0729712-35f1-4955-81db-6c74338387da",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": 2698.2234,
        "Y": 83.77197
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 759.89307,
        "Y": 250.1322
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "c160e623-08f7-4ba0-b9ee-701fa728eec6",
      "Label": "Use an integer count to pick a string from a list...",
      "ParentSectionId": "d0729712-35f1-4955-81db-6c74338387da",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": 2703.3655,
        "Y": 555.6715
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 754.751,
        "Y": 212.0
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "c6d0cf73-962f-4e66-ade9-60fb8e72f0d4",
      "Label": "* These are automatically connected to time.",
      "ParentSectionId": "5f9df0dd-39ec-49e9-894b-e820413fdb70",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.4627451,
        "Y": 0.4627451,
        "Z": 0.4627451,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": 224.96747,
        "Y": 1207.2716
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 891.7702,
        "Y": 114.04358
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "d0729712-35f1-4955-81db-6c74338387da",
      "Label": "Here is a more elaborate example of how to use an animation event...",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": 2489.9568,
        "Y": 36.204468
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 1761.1332,
        "Y": 1072.5112
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "d1a48210-aa37-4a47-bc5b-ecb4974738b2",
      "Title": "(even if you didn't love it in school).\nUnderstanding these 3 functions will be a game-changer for your work.",
      "Label": "Math is your friend ",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": -407.5071,
        "Y": 219.70587
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 601.00867,
        "Y": 236.59857
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "d5214db2-60b4-42b3-9a43-3297dd325454",
      "Title": "You can adjust the steps by dragging with CTRL.\nCheck out the modes. It's very flexible.\n",
      "Label": "[SequenceAnim] generates repetitive patterns.",
      "ParentSectionId": "5f9df0dd-39ec-49e9-894b-e820413fdb70",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": 225.75876,
        "Y": 519.42236
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 689.5497,
        "Y": 170.93835
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "e068acab-3f1f-4c4a-936a-2d5a631b18d1",
      "Title": "It's probably easier to check out one of the tutorial videos for that.\n\nHere's a short example of what you could do with that.\nPress play to activate the soundtrack.",
      "Label": "Reactions to audio input or the current project soundtrack.",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": 1278.3555,
        "Y": 32.496338
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 599.02594,
        "Y": 335.9624
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "e297379b-e86e-465d-9470-b7744aaf4b80",
      "Title": "to create a bouncy font size.",
      "Label": "Combine two [TriggerAnimation] with [Remap] ",
      "ParentSectionId": "d0729712-35f1-4955-81db-6c74338387da",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": 2700.1516,
        "Y": 333.90417
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 759.208,
        "Y": 221.76733
      }
    },
    {
      "Id": "ed0d2b3a-8791-4b08-a04b-408338187908",
      "Title": "in the Time Control Bar, you can toggle between Dopesheet and Curve mode.\nDragging keyframes while holding the Shift key toggles\nsnapping.",
      "Label": "Click on \"DopeView\" / \"CurveEditor\"",
      "ParentSectionId": "10deadb1-757b-4c5a-a798-7184a5868feb",
      "Color": {
        "X": 0.6,
        "Y": 0.6,
        "Z": 0.6,
        "W": 1.0
      },
      "Position": {
        "X": 1898.979,
        "Y": 249.09521
      },
      "Size": {
        "X": 543.9248,
        "Y": 117.68942
      }
    }
